WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.147
If you decide against an edit, Discard draft restores the published version.

00:00:06.197 --> 00:00:10.345
Here, we save a temporary search title, then discard it.

00:00:10.395 --> 00:00:14.768
The confirmation protects against losing work accidentally.

00:00:14.818 --> 00:00:20.090
Discard affects unpublished changes, not the page that is already live.
